### Security Guidelines
- **Input Validation**: Validate all user inputs for `title`, `content`, `createdBy`, `modifiedBy`, and `summary` to ensure they conform to expected formats and lengths. Use a strict allowlist for valid characters and lengths. For example:
  ```javascript
  if (typeof title !== 'string' || title.length > 100) throw new Error('Invalid title');
